<title>USA: Top Source sees near break-even Q2 net.</title>
<headline>Top Source sees near break-even Q2 net.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Top Source Technologies Inc said on Thursday it foresees improved results for the second quarter of 1997, projecting net income near the break-even mark and positive gross cash flow in line with annualized projections.</p>
<p>The company said the improvement would be due to higher sales of its overhead speaker systems and its on-site oil analyzers.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
